<title>POLAND: Elektromontaz plans no 1996 dividend.</title>
<headline>Elektromontaz plans no 1996 dividend.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction company Elektromontaz Export plans no 1996 dividend as all last year's net profit of 835,777 zlotys is to be shifted to its reserve capital, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said the company's general shareholders' meeting on April 25 will make a final decision.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
